Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(certify): guard stage generator, ctxgas fixes

gen_guard.py writes the guard stage of a run whose final EVM IR has
blocks outside the loop checker; gen_ctxgas.py checks the effect form
of the program and expects its real axioms.
